# What we're building

A script that takes the raw 492MB dataset, 
    - filters it down to Delta
    - reconstructs customer-brand reply pairs 
    - applies cleaning rules
The output is a clean, structured file that every later phase(retrieval index, eval set, agent) will read from.
This also fixes the mid-thread-fragment problem as this phase is where we tag which messages are genuine opening complaints (is_thread_root) vs mid-conversation replies, so later phases can filter appropriately.

